==Trivia==
*The robot on the enemy base is a parody unit based on a combination of [[wikia:gundam:MS-09B Dom|MS-09 Dom]] and [[wikia:gundam:MS-06 Zaku II|MS-06 Zaku]], riding the [[wikia:gundam:SCV-70 White Base|Pegasus White Base]] from the ''[[wikipedia:Mobile Suit Gundam|Mobile Suit Gundam]]'' series.
*Aguham's name may be a vague reference to ''Mobile Suit Gundam''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s [[wikia:gundam:Anaheim Electronics|Anaheim Electronics]]. The resemblance is clearer in Japanese, with Aguham's name in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] being アグハムム ''Aguhamumu'' and Anaheim being アナハイム ''Anahaimu''.

